OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA band of cloud and rain
OL,6,Falready across north Wales will
OL,7,Fgradually sink south across the
OL,8,Fcountry during the day. Some heavier
OL,9,Fbursts possible. Rather windy, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures near normal.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud around
OL,14,Fon Sunday, before another area of rain
OL,15,Farrives from the west for Monday.
OL,16,FTurning rather showers on Tuesday,
OL,17,Fwith a risk of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
